        <p class="case-subtitle">A calm booking experience that helps customers
          choose confidently and venue managers stay in control.</p>

        <dl class="case-summary" aria-label="Project summary">
          <div>
            <dt>Role</dt>
            <dd>UX/UI design and prototyping</dd>
          </div>
